          "fontWeight": "$weight/semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hE8jV",
          "name": "Request journey detail",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Overview, Inbox, task rows/cards and task detail use Choose audience, Review material & decide, and Inspect execution consistently. Open Q-204, inspect the supplied draft excerpt, return with the selection, submit, read the recorded confirmation, then return to the anchored queue. No next request opens automatically.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/body",
          "fontSize": "$type/sm",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/regular"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jZdG7",
          "name": "Keyboard and phone heading",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Keyboard and phone",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/heading",
          "fontSize": "$type/lg",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "I24gb4",
          "name": "Keyboard and phone detail",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tab follows reading order. A 2px primary outline shows focus; a filled radio dot shows selection independently. Arrow keys move choices; Space selects; Enter on Submit records only after confirmation. Evidence return restores the invoking control. Queue return restores filters, scroll anchor and row focus. Reserve room above the virtual keyboard and safe area; controls never cover content.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/body",
          "fontSize": "$type/sm",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/regular"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "riSrP",
          "name": "Errors, stale reads and uncertain writes heading",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Errors, stale reads and uncertain writes",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/heading",
          "fontSize": "$type/lg",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S8MnIR",
          "name": "Errors, stale reads and uncertain writes detail",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Confirmed failures retain selection/text and unresolved status. A failed refresh labels retained evidence with its last read time. Stale, cancelled or already answered requests cannot be overwritten. Unknown submission outcomes use reconciliation; never blindly retry a command or claim it failed. Unsupported input remains unresolved, with no ordinary-chat fallback.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/body",
          "fontSize": "$type/sm",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/regular"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AQ4ax",
          "name": "Composer disclosures heading",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Composer disclosures",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/heading",
          "fontSize": "$type/lg",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vZDqk",
          "name": "Composer disclosures detail",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Project, title and outcome remain first. Optional settings summaries name supplied context, reference, permitted assignee and dependencies. An error count remains visible when collapsed; submit opens the relevant group and focuses the first invalid control. Collapse/reopen preserves values. Save draft requires confirmed persistence. Unfinished input on this device is not a saved Ensemble task.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/body",
          "fontSize": "$type/sm",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/regular"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Z71FC",
          "name": "Task workspace and history heading",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Task workspace and history",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/heading",
          "fontSize": "$type/lg",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oOsaC",
          "name": "Task workspace and history detail",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Outcome → situation / next actor → unresolved decisions → evidence → disclosed assignments. Lead accountability remains separate from execution ownership. AT-155 → A-108 → C-108 names the task, repair assignment and conversation. No summary is inferred from activity or partial capture. Expanded history shows the latest three captured messages + result, with earlier messages, omissions and redactions accessible.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/body",
          "fontSize": "$type/sm",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/regular"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Yr8LA",
          "name": "Completion, control and source boundaries heading",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Completion, control and source boundaries",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/heading",
          "fontSize": "$type/lg",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zbSxJ",
          "name": "Completion, control and source boundaries detail",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Ready is not running or complete. Done needs recorded lead completion; cancellation does not satisfy dependencies. Provider closure is not delivery. Stop remains best-effort; uncertain execution retains ownership and capacity holds. Answering or approving clears no independent pause, Stop, dependency or recovery hold. Local messages remain separate from existing permitted GitHub writes.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/body",
          "fontSize": "$type/sm",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/regular"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "U6ZeB",
          "name": "Static review checklist heading",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Static review checklist",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/heading",
          "fontSize": "$type/lg",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Sp3kF",
          "name": "Static review checklist detail",
          "fill": "$color/on-surface",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Check readable titles and supporting text; role-based fonts and semantic colours; focused versus selected controls; aligned edges; no clipped evidence or covered actions; matching state / next actor / attention across entry points; failed input retained; exact approval revisions and dependency hold still visible. These are canvas checks, not implementation or runtime test results.\n\nSPEC.md is authoritative: board placement describes work state; readiness and execution holds remain separate. Ready-but-blocked retains its Ready label in the Waiting column, preserving the existing mapping recorded in UI03. The stale Pen placement has been corrected across cross-project, project and phone boards; no readiness or admission rule changes.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading/1-5",
          "fontFamily": "$font/body",
          "fontSize": "$type/sm",
          "fontWeight": "$weight/regular"
        }
      ]
    },
